    {
     "text": "Two MecCog hypotheses split the cellular bottleneck.",
     "start": 0.2,
     "end": 3.288
    },
    {
     "text": "H2 proposes that APOE4 impairs ApoER2 recycling in",
     "start": 3.729,
     "end": 9.047
    },
    {
     "text": "early endosomes, where the exchanger NHE6 sets pH.",
     "start": 9.116,
     "end": 13.772
    },
    {
     "text": "In H5, APOE4 astrocytes show 3-fold more",
     "start": 14.213,
     "end": 18.451
    },
    {
     "text": "cholesterol colocalized with lysosomes,",
     "start": 18.498,
     "end": 20.959
    },
    {
     "text": "and APOE4 microglia downregulate 53 of 84",
     "start": 21.203,
     "end": 25.707
    },
    {
     "text": "lysosomal hydrolases and V-ATPases.",
     "start": 25.777,
     "end": 29.469
    },
    {
     "text": "Every row clicks straight back to its verbatim quote.",
